  "releaseNotes": "Users can list and revoke their signed-in sessions (opt-in, needs a migration). AddPasswordAuth<TUser, TRole, TContext> registers Identity roles. GET /external/providers lists registered sign-in providers, and account routes map with no provider. GET /manage/2fa returns recoveryCodesLeft, and enabling two-factor keeps the step-up confirmation. JWT startup requires the signing key for the selected algorithm.",
